{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible then move towards it; if object is approached then take it, in order to check properties. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveTowardsObject    /> <Action ID = SearchForObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = ObjectPropertiesCheck    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />\"",
    "BT": {
